{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;To remember is to suffer, but to forget is to vanish&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in your apartment, the night feels ordinary. Until it doesn\u2019t. Voices in empty rooms. Shadows in still air. Everyday tasks bending into something you can\u2019t explain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/484cc1b5e3e1eee383e97f0487531d1a.poster.avif?t=1759002158\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/484cc1b5e3e1eee383e97f0487531d1a.webm?t=1759002158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/484cc1b5e3e1eee383e97f0487531d1a.mp4?t=1759002158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a slow-burn psychological horror where the line between memory and reality begins to blur. Explore, survive, and discover what\u2019s waiting in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Narrative-Driven Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply personal story hidden beneath the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Immersive First-Person Perspective</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing feels quite real. But nothing is completely fake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Haunted Mundanity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do the ordinary. Notice the difference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Atmospheric Sound Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound matters. Every silence is worse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Piece Together the Truth</strong><br>Clues are scattered in the environment, the dialogue, the flicker of a screen. Do you really want to remember?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains themes of mental distress, trauma, and psychological manipulation.<br>Play with headphones. And maybe\u2026 don\u2019t play alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/8bf8804acf85d0b87aedb59127dd3f07.poster.avif?t=1759002158\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/8bf8804acf85d0b87aedb59127dd3f07.webm?t=1759002158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893210/extras/8bf8804acf85d0b87aedb59127dd3f07.mp4?t=1759002158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893210/cf57eaac37d30633cfc0ee4d59cb6ce43fe9a8ac.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893210/fdac6da3c92043388a424cb0ae1da97005db4824.jpg"},{"name":"Clean Freak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893210/d0ef0ad5b8de7f24dce4e579dcb21a12ecc6d0b5.jpg"},{"name":"Support Small Streamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893210/46e7198a9a29036e29c582ca322ad7b98a6ecd13.jpg"},{"name":"For a Moment, I Was Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893210/ce9dec67d646761d5947c4421d92c78822c7ab24.jpg"},{"name":"Mysterious Board","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893210/df36cea6caf7e575ed5cab6993b1592c80c33b9b.jpg"}],"total":6},"b